<title>UK: Dong Ah Construction set $100 mln convertible bond.</title>
<headline>Dong Ah Construction set $100 mln convertible bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced</p>
<p>by joint lead managers Flemings, LR Securities and Dong Ah</p>
<p>Securities.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DONG AH CONSTRUCTION</p>
<p> AMT    $100 MLN	COUPON     0.25	MATURITY    31.DEC.07</p>
<p> TYPE   CONVERTIBLE   ISS PRICE  PAR	 PAY DATE    10.JUN.97</p>
<p>DENOMS (K) FIVE</p>
<p>NOTES</p>
<p>CONVERTIBLE INTO SHARES OR EDR'S OF DONG AH CONSTRUCTION.</p>
<p>CONVERSION PRICE  KRW20,000 -REPRESENTS AN 11.0 PCT PREMIUM</p>
<p>OVER</p>
<p>FIVE DAY AVERAGE CLOSING SHARE PRICE KRW18,020 TO 29.MAY.97.</p>
<p>SHARES PER $5,000 BOND EQUALS 223.15.</p>
<p>PUT ON 10.JUN.02 AT 141.928 PCT TO YIELD APPROXIMATELY 7.47 PCT</p>
<p>ANNUALLY -REPRESENTS +70 BP OVER FIVE YEAR UST.</p>
<p>HARD NON CALL FOR ONE YEAR, CALLABLE AT ACCRETED VALUE UNTIL</p>
<p>END</p>
<p>YEAR FIVE, AND THEREAFTER CALLABLE AT PAR.</p>
<p>CALL TRIGGER 130 PCT UNTIL END OF YEAR THREE, THEREAFTER CALL</p>
<p>TRIGGER 142 PCT.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
